                <pb facs="0181" n="175" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg175"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <p>In clause 7, subclause 2, of the British bill the following phrase occurs:</p>
                <p>“Where * * * it is proved that the ship sailed from its port of departure before
                    the scheduled provisions were published there,” etc. The publication referred to
                    is that of the provisions of the award, not that of the bill.</p>
            </div>
